# Voice Print — shared with GitHub Copilot

Follow [tools/voice-print/CHAT-PRINT.md](../tools/voice-print/CHAT-PRINT.md).

When the user's message is **only** `print` (case-insensitive), or clearly means "print this now":

1. Use MCP **`print`** immediately (no file → default combined pack).
2. If MCP unavailable: `cd tools/voice-print && npm run print -- docs/combined-print.html`
3. Confirm file and printer IP `192.168.1.157`.

**Copilot equivalent:** `@voice-print` agent — see `.github/agents/voice-print.agent.md`.

**Apps:** [tools/voice-print/APPS.md](../tools/voice-print/APPS.md) — Cursor mobile/cloud cannot print; use phone browser.

Setup: `voice-print` in `~/.cursor/mcp.json` (see `.cursor/mcp.json.example`).
